Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: smd-rpm: Fix wrongly assigned RPM_SMD_PNOC_CLK
Date:   Sun,  6 Jun 2021 21:26:57 +0200
Message-Id: <20210606192657.51037-1-konrad.dybcio@somainline.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.31.1
